---
import Scroll from "./Scroll.astro";
import Bio from "./Bio.astro";
---

<section id="the-problem" aria-labelledby="problem-h">
  <a href="#top" class="top" aria-label="Back to top">top</a>
  <Bio />
  <article class="about">
    <p>
      We all lose sight of the opportunity sometimes. Discussions get stuck in
      the weeds until nothing gets decided. The day-to-day prevails, while
      short-term wins are celebrated. Teams build their own copies to keep
      control. Everyone asks when it will be ready, but nobody dares to say.
    </p>
    <p>
      That’s where I quietly step in. I can take on a range of roles for a
      while, whether you’re looking for product, engineering, architecture or
      executive leadership. My expertise is in digital platforms, data and AI.
    </p>
  </article>

  <div class="pillars">
    <article class="pillar_1">
      <h2>Back on track</h2>
      <p>
        Modernisation stops competing with the business when you make it part
        of your organisation and culture. That change starts when leaders turn
        what they say into how the work is done.
      </p>
    </article>
    <article class="pillar_2">
      <h2>At your pace</h2>
      <p>
        Teams keep moving at the speed your customers demand. I believe the
        easiest way has to become the right way.
      </p>
    </article>
  </div>
  <div class="scroll-container">
    <Scroll />
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about {
    grid-column: 2 / span 9;
    grid-row: 2;
    padding-top: 0;
  }

  .pillars {
    grid-column: 2 / span 9;
    grid-row: 3;

    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 4rem;
  }

  .pillar_1,
  .pillar_2 {
    flex: 1 1 0;
    min-width: 0;
  }

  /* Below this width the pillar columns get too narrow for their
	   titles, forcing a mid-word break, so stack the pillars instead. */
  @media screen and (max-width: 1153px) {
    .pillars {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: stretch;
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 600px) {
    .about {
      grid-column: 1 / span 12;
    }

    .pillars {
      grid-column: 1 / span 12;
    }
  }
</style>
